        "textAlign": "left",
        "fontFamily": "Gothic A1, sans-serif",
        "fontWeight": 300,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "[recipient.name] played a pivotal role in several high-priority projects, leading teams with a strong commitment to innovation and excellence. His technical expertise, leadership, and ability to meet challenging deadlines were integral to our project success.",
      "autoScale": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
